\\[\n   96 \\times 50 = 96 \\times 5 \\times 10 = 480 \\times 10 = 4800\n   \\]\n\n3. **Sum the results of the two steps:**\n   \\[\n   864 + 4800 = 5664\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, the product of 96 and 59 is \\(\\boxed{5664}\\).",
